sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant U as User
    participant O as Order

    Note over O: Order is in CREATED status with its items added

    activate C
    C->>U: placeOrder(order)
    activate U
    U->>O: updateStatus(CONFIRMED)
    activate O
    O->>O: status = CONFIRMED
    O->>U: notify("Your order has been confirmed")
    deactivate O
    U-->>C: None (customer sees "Your order has been confirmed")
    deactivate U
    deactivate C